  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 301.09 Criteria for Issuance of Permit",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 301.09 Criteria for Issuance of Permit. The department shall issue a permit if it determines that the information provided by the applicant establishes that the proposed discharge:\n\n(a) Will not violate any applicable provision of RSA 485-A; and\n\n(b) Will not cause or contribute to a violation of Env-Wq 1700.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Wq 301) #10348, eff 5-22-13; ss by #13613, eff 5-22-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq300.html"
